        "handle": "h2-34afdbba",
        "new_text": "/// Returns the median of the values, or `None` for an empty slice.\n///\n/// Values are converted to `f64` before averaging, so `i64::MAX` values\n/// never overflow.\npub fn median(values: &[i64]) -> Option<f64> {\n    let mut sorted = values.to_vec();\n    sorted.sort();\n\n    let n = sorted.len();\n    if n == 0 {\n        return None;\n    }\n\n    if n % 2 == 1 {\n        Some(sorted[n / 2] as f64)\n    } else {\n        let low = sorted[n / 2 - 1] as f64;\n        let high = sorted[n / 2] as f64;\n        Some(low + (high - low) / 2.0)\n    }\n}\n",
        "path": "src/lib.rs"
